{'symbol': 'NEM', 'date': '2022-09-12 07:00:00', 'title': 'FURY GOLD AND NEWMONT COMPLETE CONSOLIDATION OF JOINT VENTURE INTERESTS AND DEFINE NINE TARGETS AT\xa0ÉLÉONORE\xa0SOUTH GOLD PROJECT', 'text': 'VANCOUVER, BC / ACCESSWIRE / SEPTEMBER 12, 2022 / FURY GOLD MINES LIMITED (TSX:FURY)(NYSE AMERICAN:FURY) ("FURY" OR THE "COMPANY") IS PLEASED TO ANNOUNCE THAT THE COMPANY AND NEWMONT CORPORATION (NYSE: NEM, TSX: NGT) ("NEWMONT"), THROUGH THEIR RESPECTIVE SUBSIDIARIES, HAVE COMPLETED THE PREVIOUSLY ANNOUNCED BUY-OUT OF THE REMAINING APPROXIMATELY 23.77% PARTICIPATING INTEREST OF AZIMUT EXPLORATION INC. IN THE ÉLÉONORE SOUTH JOINT VENTURE ("ESJV"), ON A PRO-RATA BASIS. AS A RESULT OF THE TRANSACTION, THE 100% ESJV PARTICIPATING INTERESTS ARE FURY 50.022% AND NEWMONT 49.978% WITH FURY REMAINING OPERATOR UNDER AN AMENDED AND RESTATED JOINT VENTURE AGREEMENT.'}